      "source_words_sha256": "9b8ac223e462cde71356a40e050d9a432977d49e5cb38c0cc047c3473a7891e8",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Suspicious, yes...\n[ctrl:FFA2]But not the kind\nwe're looking for.",
